# ---- Generated run outputs ----
# Every stage writes into its own *_results/ directory. Raw traces total
# ~550 MB (individual CSVs up to 54 MB, NPZ archives up to 44 MB), so no
# run output is tracked: results are fully reproducible from the scripts
# plus the fixed seeds documented in the README.
*_results/
